    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 1993-10-05; see the Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Well; anxious but composed</td></tr><tr><td>Breasts</td><td>Left: 1.5 cm firm, irregular, painless mass eccentric to the nipple at 2 o&apos;clock, not fixed to the chest wall; mild bruising from the biopsy; no nipple retraction or discharge. Right: no mass and no glandular enlargement</td></tr><tr><td>Lymph nodes</td><td>One firm, mobile 1 cm left axillary node; no right axillary, supraclavicular, or cervical nodes</td></tr><tr><td>Abdomen</td><td>Soft; liver not enlarged</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>No spinal tenderness</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

